elvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI斥资逾200亿美元采购Cerebras算力并获最高10%股权</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI宣布ChatGPT周活跃用户突破10亿，女性用户占比首次超过50%</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布生命科学模型GPT-Rosalind，深度赋能药物研发与蛋白质工程</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌Gemini接入Google Photos，支持调用个人相册生成个性化图像</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/27234ec0b3f822767f2f5a2fd87eb889.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌宣布旗下AI助手Gemini正式接入用户个人相片库，通过开启Personal Intelligence功能，系统可整合谷歌应用数据以提供更具个性化的交互体验。此次更新的核心在于打通了私人影像与AI生成能力之间的技术壁垒，配合图像生成工具Nano Banana，用户无需手动上传照片，即可直接调取Google Photos中的私人影像素材。例如，用户可要求Gemini生成包含特定家人参与某项活动的动画风格图片，系统将自动完成创作。这一功能升级标志着AI图像生成从泛化模型向真正意义上的个人化创作迈进，通过深度集成用户私有数据，显著提升了生成内容的场景相关性与定制化程度，为用户提供更精准的视觉内容创作支持。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达发布3D场景生成系统Lyra2.0，单照可构建90米虚拟环境</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/05507a6a0bc7555d5306882a7c31fc5d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达研究团队于2026年4月16日发布3D场景生成系统Lyra2.0，该系统支持通过单张照片生成延伸范围达90米的3D环境。针对长距离相机路径下的图像失真与误差累积难题，Lyra2.0采用双重策略：实时存储3D几何信息以确保环境一致性，并引入缺陷数据训练以实现模型自我纠偏。基准测试显示，其在图像质量与相机控制等维度优于GEN3C、Yume-1.5等六个竞争对手，快速版本生成效率提升13倍。目前，Lyra2.0已实现与Nvidia Isaac Sim物理引擎的无缝衔接，生成的3D场景可直接导出为网格模型。该技术为自动驾驶及通用机器人（AGI）提供了高效的仿真训练基础设施，显著降低了对现实世界大规模3D数据采集的依赖，标志着AI在3D空间理解与实时环境模拟领域取得重要进展。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI斥资逾200亿美元采购Cerebras算力并获最高10%股权</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5d9bbadad0955c8f71f85b739f070c20.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI已与芯片初创公司Cerebras达成协议，未来三年将斥资逾200亿美元采购其芯片驱动的服务器算力，并获得Cerebras最高10%的股权认股权证。该协议在今年1月签署的100亿美元采购750兆瓦算力协议基础上进一步扩大，OpenAI还将额外提供约10亿美元资助Cerebras建设数据中心，预计未来三年总支出或达300亿美元。Cerebras以晶圆级引擎芯片技术闻名，此次深度绑定被视为其冲击二季度上市的核心支撑。Cerebras计划下月完成30亿美元融资，届时估值预计达350亿美元。此举凸显了OpenAI对高性能推理算力的迫切需求，通过资本与业务的双重深度绑定，OpenAI旨在确保其在大规模模型训练与推理基础设施上的算力供应稳定性，同时也为Cerebras的资本市场表现提供了强力背书。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI宣布ChatGPT周活跃用户突破10亿，女性用户占比首次超过50%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/46f2e09c4f68083f5f3ee48443871a34.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI最新数据显示，ChatGPT全球周活跃用户数即将突破10亿大关。自2022年发布以来，该平台用户性别结构发生显著演变，女性用户占比已从早期的20%跃升至超过50%，目前约有5亿女性定期使用该工具，标志着AI技术在不同群体中的普及度大幅提升。在算力基础设施方面，OpenAI正加速扩张，其可用算力预计将从2023年的0.2吉瓦增长至2025年的1.9吉瓦，年均增长率达3倍。这一增长得益于其与英伟达等合作伙伴签署的超30吉瓦算力协议，OpenAI计划到2030年实现30吉瓦的算力储备。用户规模的爆发式增长与算力资源的持续扩容，将进一步支撑ChatGPT在复杂任务处理及服务体验上的迭代，巩固其在AI领域的市场领先地位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布生命科学模型GPT-Rosalind，深度赋能药物研发与蛋白质工程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5d9bbadad0955c8f71f85b739f070c20.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于4月16日正式发布专为生命科学领域打造的AI模型GPT-Rosalind，旨在加速药物研发及蛋白质工程分析。该模型针对基因组学和化学领域进行深度微调，在LABBench2等科学基准测试中表现优异，部分预测任务已展现出超越人类专家的潜力。GPT-Rosalind目前以“研究预览”形式向安进、莫德纳、赛默飞世尔及艾伦研究所等首批合作伙伴开放。配套推出的生命科学插件支持链接超过50种专业科学工具与数据库，可协助科研人员完成证据合成、假设生成及实验规划。此次发布标志着OpenAI正式切入科学AI赛道，通过提供从数据分析到实验辅助的科研基础设施，深度介入新药研发流程。该举措引发医药行业高度关注，并对生物技术板块产生显著市场影响。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
